{"ticker":{"symbol":"000890.KS","name":"보해양조","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1210.0,"change_pct":0.007493755203996644,"market_cap":33062987776.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":4390.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Wineries & Distilleries","country":"South Korea","city":"Mokpo-si","employees":213,"website":"https://www.bohae.co.kr","business_summary":"BOHAE BREWERY Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells liquor products in South Korea. It offers alcohol products and wines under the Leaves, Bokbunjaju, Original, Soonhee, Brother Soda, Bohae Gold, and Millennium, BIDAN, and HOUKAI brands. The company also provides liquid tea products, carbonated and concentrated liquid drinks, fruit and vegetable drinks, and plum extract products under the Maewon, Maewon Deluxe, Debut, Plum Wind, Maewon Prime, Bokbun Resource Prime, Oil Resources Prime, Plum Extract Gold, and Won Plum brands; and gift sets. It also exports its products. The company was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Mokpo-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"보해맥주(주)는 한국에서 주류 제품을 제조 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 리브스, 복분자주, 오리지널, 순희, 브라더소다, 보해골드, 밀레니엄, 비단, 호카이 등의 브랜드로 주류와 와인을 판매하고 있습니다. 또한 회사는 매원, 매원 디럭스, 데뷔, 매원 바람, 매원 프라임, 복분 리소스 프라임, 오일 리소스 프라임, 매원 추출 골드, 원 매실 브랜드로 액상 차 제품, 탄산 및 농축 액상 음료, 과일 및 야채 음료, 매실 추출물 제품을 제공합니다. 그리고 선물세트. 또한 자사 제품을 수출합니다. 이 회사는 1950년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 목포시에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"주류","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":90858780910.0,"operating_income":61880020.0,"net_income":-2828783630.0,"eps":-100.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":93084785140.0,"operating_income":-2803701860.0,"net_income":-3555068220.0,"eps":-130.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":87624248940.0,"operating_income":2328406960.0,"net_income":6685688830.0,"eps":245.0},{"period":